<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_头部、五官与感官构造 (Head, Face & Sensory Organs)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 60 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='22%'>单词 (英 / 法性数完整形态)</th><th width='14%'>音标 (英 / 法 IPA)</th><th width='22%'>中文释义</th><th width='24%'>英文定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='6%'>词频</th><th width='12%'>实物配图</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>imperial<span class='badge-conv'>兼类词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'impérial<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='fr-pl-badge' title='不规则复数形式'>pl. impériaux</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 imperial</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/im'piәriәl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɛ̃peʁjal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('imperial', 'l\'impérial')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 特等品</td><td class='def-en'>a small tufted beard worn by Emperor Napoleon III</td><td>4.21</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_1' data-word="imperial" src='images/imperial.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('imperial', 'human', 'img_1')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>tooth</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le bec<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 tooth</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/tu:θ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bɛk/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('tooth', 'le bec')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 牙齿, 齿状物, 爱好</td><td class='def-en'>hard bonelike structures in the jaws of vertebrates; used for biting and chewing or for attack and defense</td><td>4.08</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_2' data-word="tooth" src='images/tooth.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('tooth', 'human', 'img_2')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>beard</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la barbe<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 beard</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/biәd/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/baʁb/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('beard', 'la barbe')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 胡须</td><td class='def-en'>the hair growing on the lower part of a man's face</td><td>4.07</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_3' data-word="beard" src='images/beard.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('beard', 'human', 'img_3')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>hawk nose<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le nez<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 hawk nose</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/hɔ:k nəuz/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ne/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('hawk nose', 'le nez')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>鹰钩鼻</td><td class='def-en'>a nose curved downward like the beak of a hawk</td><td>3.77</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_4' data-word="hawk nose" src='images/hawk_nose.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('hawk nose', 'human', 'img_4')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>lateral line<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la ligne latérale<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 lateral line</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈlætərəl lain/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/liɲ lateʁal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('lateral line', 'la ligne latérale')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>侧线</td><td class='def-en'>sense organs of fish and amphibians; believed to detect pressure changes in the water</td><td>3.74</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_5' data-word="lateral line" src='images/lateral_line.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('lateral line', 'human', 'img_5')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>haircut</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la coiffure<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 haircut</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'hєәkʌt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kwafyʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('haircut', 'la coiffure')" title='播放当前语言发音 (法语连读冠词)'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 理发, (男子的)发式</td><td class='def-en'>the style in which hair has been cut</td><td>3.7</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_6' data-word="haircut" src='images/haircut.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('haircut', 'human', 'img_6')" title='点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
